  lex_identifiers_err_at.pcpp - break step of lex_identifiers.pcpp:
  an @ with no directive name after it (LX0009)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\lex_identifiers_err_at.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\lex_identifiers_err_at.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
